   "html": "<p>Partnering with the CatCafe in Los Angeles, IHC produced an all-day livestream highlighting cats for Marvel's upcoming film<em> The Marvels.</em> IHC developed the stream narrative and crafted a detailed run of the show, including segments and custom on-screen graphics.The cafe was transformed to  resemble a S.A.B.E.R. space station with custom built elements for the cats to navigate through. </p>\n<p>Fans of the film were able to tune in over the span of eight hours and virtually interact with the cats, building excitement for the film’s release  while also supporting the cafe’s main goal to bring awareness to these fluffs up for adoption.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "unboxing",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Disney Consumer Products provided a variety of <em>Marvels</em> themed toys and merchandise, including Funko Pops, Legos, Flerkittens, and a Loungefly backpack, for display during the livestream. This was framed through unboxing segments in which cats were brought onto a table to interact and play with the items.</p>"
