   "title": "special segments",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>The livestream included segments such as “Meet the Team,” “Superhero Training,” “ASMR,” “Light Powers Battle,” and trivia. Each allowed for audience interactions to learn more about the cats on screen and immerse them in the film's world.</p>"
